      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SURREALIST (4) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (41.75) at this track. Form here sound including nine wins. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature in the finish again. SHE'S PEAKIN' (2) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at Q Lakeside over 642m behind Midnight Queen (36.60) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money prior to that. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Leading chance. KITTY ANN (8) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (41.95) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Cannot be left out. EVIE SCARLETT (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
